# MCP Server Environment Variables

# Figma MCP Server Configuration
# Get your token from: https://www.figma.com/settings
FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-figma-access-token-here

# GitHub MCP Server Configuration (for multi-server setup)
# Get your token from: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes: repo, read:org, read:user
GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-github-personal-access-token-here
